- **Breaking change:** REST API requests that still send a removed team name now fail with a 422 that links to the Fleet 5 migration guide, instead of being ignored, on the endpoints that already use the fleet names. The removed names are the `team_id` and `team_name` query parameters and the `team_id`, `team_ids`, `teams`, and `team` keys in request bodies. Use `fleet_id`, `fleet_name`, `fleet_ids`, `fleets`, and `fleet`. Sorting by `order_key=team_id` or `order_key=team_name` fails the same way; use `fleet_id` and `fleet_name`. `POST /translate` rejects the `team` type; use `fleet`. `PATCH /config` rejects `mdm.apple_bm_default_team`, and `GET /config` no longer returns it; use `mdm.apple_business`.
